foldproof device and scenario profile corpus (profiles/)

The profile files in this directory are licensed under the Community Data License Agreement –
Permissive – Version 2.0 (CDLA-Permissive-2.0): https://cdla.dev/permissive-2-0/

In short: you may use, modify, and share this data for any purpose, including commercially, with no
attribution requirement beyond keeping this notice with copies of the data files. The licence explicitly
covers database rights (including the EU sui generis database right) as well as copyright.

Each value in a profile carries its own provenance in `sources[]` (url, publisher, inspection date,
licence, upstream revision). Values quoted from third-party registries remain subject to those
registries' terms, listed in the repository NOTICE file:
  Chrome DevTools emulated devices (BSD-3-Clause), Playwright device descriptors (Apache-2.0),
  AOSP SDK device definitions (Apache-2.0), MDN browser-compat-data (CC0-1.0),
  vendor technical specifications quoted as facts.

Values marked `kind: derived` were computed by this project from cited inputs with the formula stated.
No value is marked `measured` unless this project measured it with the named tool on the named date.
